{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "d48e18f4a059694c7d07d30c4f8647ba14e1d1655bc82e502276fd0e35ba3c9d", "ja": "ダンシング・ハイッ", "zh": "Dancing High", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d567474f44820ece53cc4b1b45a28d2bdcf87bf7401b7539b8382c1475e898c1", "ja": "エミリーの様子がおかしかった原因は、ラン\nニングシューズが足に合わないために起きた\n靴ずれだった。本番までに必ず治すというエ\nミリーのために、プロデューサーはぴったり\nのシューズを用意するのだった。", "zh": "艾蜜莉的样子之所以不对劲，\n是因为跑步鞋不合脚，导致脚磨破皮了。\n艾蜜莉表示一定会在正式上场前治好，\n制作人便着手为她准备尺寸合脚的鞋子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1c055c917601b6597d3dbf61819a4085b80ea333fc18c69d5a7f19cbcbf709df", "ja": "（今日のレッスンはダンス。体力がついたおかげか、\nみんな安定度がぐっと上がっている。いい効果だ！）", "zh": "（今天的训练是舞蹈，可能是体力变好的关系，\n大家的稳定度提升很多，效果真棒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "6b0a67975d211048087b222e1abb21dac9c240c3be791d08e8ccff59204d8549", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー！", "zh": "1、2、3！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "06622a323eddc9a78318060eb8600f7d460c4671da5a5103ef6a6e907ebe19eb", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー。\nここでターンだよぉ。", "zh": "1、2、3，\n在这里转圈哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "b273650780e6edb2e3e6a5a55ad9cdfc28b0d0d68c6a18f591c59d84c2ff53ea", "ja": "いち、に、……あっ！", "zh": "一、二……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "e036c01846a7786200759f8d5f042fe4e4e60053fd51731495afb3e74b02cd05", "ja": "エミリー、気にせんといこ！\nさあ、ワンツー、ワンツー。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，别在意！\n来，1、2、1、2。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "8fa616ff9ce56b4f2e976c24c3216001bf230adcde8080f6d36c56322b822ccb", "ja": "は、はい！\nいち、に……！", "zh": "好、好的！\n一、二……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d2255a7e8debd4898d3b5dc942b836349d9a2247e937b2918dac77da4a63986d", "ja": "（エミリー、やっぱり少し様子が変だな。\nよし……）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉的样子果然有点不对劲。\n好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1cf1a202da957e5b5ec8ac85b2f2f5547a0c5f02047b1b8c37cf39852a36d326", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　体力がついたおかげか、\nダンスレッスンもほぼOKだったな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！可能是体力变好的关系，\n舞蹈训练也几乎没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "477ef1b4ce28eb8e0132adad23dbc2b4b75fc9b2602386e8f4640125b4cac59d", "ja": "あとは、きちんと体調管理をすることだ。\n万全の状態で、本番を迎えられるようにしてくれ！", "zh": "再来就是要确实做好健康管理，\n大家要用最佳状态迎向正式上场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "12e3695c43db8839268359cd3df8995dd56474d7a45eaec04e64d4413f7e62be", "ja": "は、はい。", "zh": "好、好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0ef4c35661d9a848507e118c097b9137fd85d562ec0f56bd95af4f04591ac0e8", "ja": "エミリー、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "艾蜜莉，你现在有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "f2a42a1ead9c0bf75e3c8b25b70d2fc2b50e43c9d1e2e4d143a30ca788da797e", "ja": "は、はい。\nなんでしょう、仕掛け人さま？", "zh": "有、有的。\n怎么了吗，策划执行人先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "29734167d36edd8c506bf1c08620da7df7f0c5375743f1c3972c57544f6b2ae8", "ja": "ちょっと前から、浮かない顔をしているように\n見えるんだが、なにかあったのか？", "zh": "我看你从前几天就一直闷闷不乐的，\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "259aaabc5ae6c0e53a15d0ed4fb5dace8d0b09a0504455b3c0a1dd6625eb160e", "ja": "い、いえ……その、そんな。\n……うう。", "zh": "没、没有……那个，\n没那回事……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2c9b13c62c3576445308ddc2f4e9896ddcda90f305c80304145aa3dc919437f0", "ja": "ちゃんと目を見て話せないのは、隠し事をしている\n証拠だと思う。……エミリー、話してくれないか？", "zh": "你不敢看着我的眼睛说话，应该就是有所隐瞒了……\n艾蜜莉，你愿意跟我说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "829012da15427ea9cdba3924d75c9b40a68ddbd9d58e0154b78a933d7e2e3c90", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。やはり、仕掛け人さまの\n目は誤魔化せませんね。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……\n果然瞒不过策划执行人先生的眼睛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "b9cf0fba18b523c0e7b50a4b5a0391ddab9a4032fbd3b1b4bfc2236b85f1b022", "ja": "実は、駆け足用運動靴が合わなかったのか、\n靴ずれを起こしてしまいまして……。", "zh": "其实是这样的，我的脚磨破皮了，\n可能是因为跑步用运动鞋的尺寸不合吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4bfc07443278b04697bf1dcf3b15fdd513f8ac902a9e37d10d0c79712c7170c9", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\n気づかなくて、ごめん。", "zh": "原来是这样……\n对不起，我没注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "1e224894e43d85520dab55f3cd2cf69959a54e1cb7517c739ef1a30d413b5a39", "ja": "そんな、とんでもないです！\n私がもっと早く気づいていればよかっただけですから。", "zh": "请您别这么说！\n只怪我自己没有早点发现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "c01d7ef2dc65a8b6b5777dc265432be9d8715cbcd8f16a4e76308526248ae2bf", "ja": "軽いものですが、まだ少し痛みがあって……\nでも、本番までには直します。大丈夫です！", "zh": "虽然是轻伤，但还是有点痛……\n不过，正式上场前会治好的，不用担心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d4099bc8239cc9aa2d41f2e69f02a9e4f7202631bd4807991d360e2f2582ebd9", "ja": "うーん。\nそうは言っても……。", "zh": "唔，就算你这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "00e52b1dad1306c8b73ea54d776d54e5a845ca14d66a27d9873e4bc326343eb9", "ja": "真夏の選手交代中継走、とっても楽しそうな催しです。\n奈緒さんも、ひなたさんも、とてもがんばっています。", "zh": "盛夏的选手交棒接力跑，感觉是个很开心的活动。\n奈绪跟日向也都非常努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "32c5e6153f7db0d73f83d9a598579d2dfc1f33c65d0b53eef352e1e2af3590d7", "ja": "だから、私も一緒にがんばりたい。おふたりの活躍を、\nたくさんのごヒイキ様方に見せたいんです！", "zh": "所以，我也想一起努力。\n我想让更多主顾看到她们两人的活跃表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "59cb7c0a5182286bfb6e05faba410a8a6d3e7d3357651a1c0bee74f389d72705", "ja": "エミリー……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "8fe77aac1b8667fa8418959860d6bbf6462b62f095f6630cf2ee4313f789ff3f", "ja": "私がおふたりの足を引っ張ってはならないと、\n少し無理をしていた自覚はあります……でも！", "zh": "我知道自己为了不扯她们两人的后腿，\n之前是有些逞强了……不过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "f24adc99bd999b9807bf983a6dcda48bd423122cb332d6090e998ca051e91382", "ja": "本番までには、きっと治してみせます。\nこれは、大和撫子を目指す者としての意地です！", "zh": "在正式上场前，我一定会治好脚伤的。\n这是目标成为大和抚子之人的志气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "274749655dd18c4b945b3fd039c39a32cc36ef709c216294dd02382d65bfe118", "ja": "そうか……エミリーの決意はわかったよ。\nだけど2つだけ、約束してほしいことがある。", "zh": "这样啊……我明白艾蜜莉的决心了。\n但是有两件事，希望你能答应我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "41d474e84028649e2fb3a24e0de9503f7d3f3ddea7718a93d390aad84a62821d", "ja": "は、はい！　……。", "zh": "好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "af7c89f984dbcbef7fd91c7e05cec33ad14dfd783bfeedcf93a5a10aa9936540", "ja": "まず足のケガは、きちんと診てもらうこと。\n靴ずれを馬鹿にしちゃダメだぞ。ケガだからな。", "zh": "第一件事，你要确实就医治疗脚伤。\n不可以小看磨破皮喔，那也是受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ff93496ab30cea5b1cfb2cfd809c148554a63cd580f7bb49d728e75b96413237", "ja": "それから。\n本番では、無理だと思ったらすぐ俺に言うこと。", "zh": "第二件事，\n正式上场时如果觉得撑不下去，要马上跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff40043778e206c4633fc4d1fb9f9b2c9b19755e23d71ae37a78c39168607f49", "ja": "わかりました、仕掛け人さま。\nその約束は、必ず、守ります。", "zh": "我知道了，策划执行人先生。\n我答应您，一定会遵守这两件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d414883b8e9e4abb185d8c1e1546b0eeb05615acbd719a958e3d1f2938b20a7e", "ja": "ありがとう、エミリー。それじゃあ、\n劇場の倉庫に行こう。探し物をしなくちゃ。", "zh": "谢谢你，艾蜜莉。\n那我们去剧场的仓库吧，得找个东西才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
